{{also|arborvitae}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|arbor||tree}} + {{m|la|vitae}}, genitive singular of {{m|la|vita||life}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[arbor]] [[vitae]]|arbor vitae|arbor vitaes|arbores vitae}}

# Any of the evergreen trees and shrubs known as [[arborvitae]], of the [[genera]] ''[[Thuja]]'' and {{taxlink|Thujopsis|genus|noshow=1}}, or of the [[species]] {{taxlink|Platycladus orientalis|species|noshow=1}}.
#* '''1882''', ''Annual Report of the Minnesota State Horticultural Society'', page 27:
#*: Next spring the owner of the hedge will be very much surprised to find a number of his '''arbor vitae''' deceased, and he will straightway blame himself and his horse? Not he! The nurseyman, sir, must have delivered him some poor stock!
# {{label|en|anatomy}} White matter of the [[cerebellum]].
#: ''connected to fibres of the arbor vitae and to divaricating axons''

